<!-- wp:heading {"level":2} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Frequently Asked Questions About Home Care</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"fontSize":"medium"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size">What is the difference between a Home Health Aide (HHA) and a Personal Care Aide (PCA)?</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Both help with daily tasks like bathing, dressing, and meal preparation, but a Home Health Aide (HHA) has extra training to monitor vital signs (like blood pressure and pulse) and assist with more specific medical care plans, while a Personal Care Aide (PCA) focuses on everyday personal comfort, grooming, and companionship.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"fontSize":"medium"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size">Does Astor Health provide care for people with Alzheimer's or dementia?</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Yes, Astor Health provides specialized in-home care for individuals living with Alzheimer's disease, dementia, Parkinson's disease, ALS, Multiple Sclerosis, stroke recovery, and traumatic brain injuries.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"fontSize":"medium"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size">What areas does Astor Health serve?</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Astor Health serves individuals and families across New York (with our main office in Manhattan at 223 E 25th St, Unit G) and Pennsylvania.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"fontSize":"medium"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size">Can I get a caregiver for 24-hour support or just a few hours a week?</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Yes, we build custom schedules ranging from a few hours a week for housework and errands to full 24/7 around-the-clock care at home.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"fontSize":"medium"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size">How can healthcare facilities or careers applicants contact Astor Health?</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Families and healthcare partners can call <a href="tel:7184967111">(718) 496-7111</a> or email <a href="mailto:info@astorhealth.com">info@astorhealth.com</a>. Caregivers looking to join our team can call <a href="tel:6468772943">(646) 877-2943</a> or email <a href="mailto:recruitment@astorhealth.com">recruitment@astorhealth.com</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

</div>
